 "text": "JUMP TO MENU\nJUMP TO CONTENT\nJUMP TO FOOTER\nMENU\nOur Brands\nSkin Care\nHair Care\nHair Colour\nBody Care\nSun Care\nTools and Services\nIngredients\nExplore\nAbout Garnier\nAbout Ingredients\nNew! Garnier x Gisele\nTips & How To's\nTools and Services\nSEARCH\nHair colour Virtual Try-On\n\nTry before you buy with our advanced technology! Discover our Virtual Try On tool, the safe and easy way to check out the colour without any commitment.\n\nTry on shades live now\n\nHome\nVirtual Try On\nTest out all our Garnier shades with Hair colour Virtual Try On\n\nTrying a new shade has never been easier. Have fun changing your hair colour with our virtual try-on tool.\n\nTRY ON NOW\n\nFind your perfect shade with our Virtual Try-On\n\nShop or share with your friends\n\nTime for the verdict! Save the image to send to your friends or share your new virtual look straight to social media to see their reaction. Don’t forget to add #MyGarnierShade! If you’ve found the perfect shade, you can buy it now with our online retail partners or in store. Worried about how compatible your chosen shade will be for your hair? Try our Color Match quiz to be sure it’s a perfect match.\n\nTRY ON SHADES\n\nChoose your mode to start trying shades on\n\nThe best way to test Garnier hair colour is to try before you buy! Trying on any shade is now as easy as using a filter, thanks to our Virtual Try On technology. To get started, you need to select whether to try on live with your phone’s camera or webcam, or if you prefer to upload a selfie. Either works great!\n\nTRY ON SHADES\n\nBrowse to find the shade that suits you\n\nYour virtual hair makeover awaits! Flip through all our shades, compare your favs and find the perfect hair color for you without committing. Make sure you have good lighting and are using your native browser for the best experience.\n\nTRY ON SHADES\nSLIDE PAUSE\nSLIDE 1\nSLIDE 2\nSLIDE 3\nNot sure which shade is perfect for you?\n\nGarnier Color Match uses all our hair colour expertise to bring you a personal recommendation and let you virtually try it on. Your new look is just a few clicks away.\n\nStart the Color Match Quiz\n\nTry our best sellers\nTRY IT ON\nNUTRISSE ULTRA COLOR\nNutrisse Ultra Color D4+ Platinum Bleach\n4.5139 out of 5 stars based on reviews\nSEE ALL 144 REVIEWS\nTRY IT ON\nNUTRISSE ULTRA COLOR\nNutrisse Ultra Color 7.40 Copper Passion Permanent Hair Dye\n4.1875 out of 5 stars based on reviews\nSEE ALL 96 REVIEWS\n\nSee all products\n\nFIND OUT MORE ABOUT HAIR COLOR\n\nHAIR COLOUR\n\nWhat colour should I dye my hair?\n\n5 tips to choose a hair colour that suits you. Discover all the beauty tips and advice on Hair Colour for different hair types, by Garnier.\n\nREAD MORE\n\nBLEACH\n\nCan You Get Bold Hair Colour Without Bleach?\n\nNeed a style that’s a bit more dramatic, but you don’t want to bleach your tresses? No problem, with Garnier, you can get bold hair colour without bleach.\n\nREAD MORE\n\nCOLOURED HAIR CARE\n\nChanging Your Hair Colour - First Steps\n\nWant to change up your look by changing your hair colour? Read on for some expert tips\nMany celebrities have been going for dramatic hair colour changes recently, but changing your hair colour for the first time can be a risky process. There are some fail-safe steps you can take, though, to ensure your hair colour transformation goes off without a hitch.\n\nREAD MORE\n\nYou’re 1 selfie away from glowing skin\n\nTake a selfie to scan your face and get a personalized routine for your skin type and needs .\n\nGET STARTED\nFAQ's\n\nWhat hair colour would suit me?\n\nHow to try on hair color virtually?\n\nWhat would I look like with grey hair?\n\nWhat will I look like with blonde hair?\n\nWhat will I look like with brown hair?\n\nWhat will I look like with red hair?\n\nHow can I check if your online hair colour changer tool works for roots?\n\nCan I share the virtual hair try on results with friends?\n\nTalk to a Garnier brand ambassador?\n\nWEBSITE LINKS\n\nHome\nStore Finder\nSitemap\nTerms And Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nCookie Settings\n\n©2024 Garnier\n\nCUSTOMER SERVICE\n\nCareers\nContact Us\n\nFOLLOW US\n\nAddress\nGARNIER\n14, rue Royale 75008 Paris France\ngarnier@uk.oaccare.com\nEnhance Your Experience!\nYour privacy is important to us so we want to be clear on what information is collected when you visit our sites. During your visit, we may need to retrieve and/or store your browser information, mostly in the form of cookies. This information might be about you, your choices, or your device and is mostly used to offer you a more personalised experience. It’s your choice what we collect. You can find out more about the different categories of cookies we use and how to opt-in to these specific categories by clicking the ‘Cookies Settings’ link below. Remember, not allowing some cookies might negatively impact your experience as we might not be able to offer you some of our services and/or features. To learn more about how we and our partners use your personal information, please see ourPrivacy Policy\nCookies Settings\nReject All Allow All",
